<title>POLAND: BIG 1995/96 group results.</title>
<headline>BIG 1995/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych group results for fiscal year ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					  1 OCT. 1995 - 30 SEPT. 1996</p>
<p>    profit on banking activity		259.73</p>
<p>    net profit				    110.03</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit				100.32</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities		    1.75</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues	   485.67</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs		319.89</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission		   30.21</p>
<p>    costs of commission			  12.97</p>
<p>    income tax					7.55</p>
<p>    other taxes				     4.93</p>
<p>    extraordinary losses			  0.55</p>
<p>NOTE: BIG did not provide comparative figures for the previous financial year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
